- Ban purple/indigo AI gradients. Use a crisp ClearTax/Razorpay Industrial Ledger palette (`#FAF8F5` surface, `#111827` text, `#DC2626` math error alert, `#D97706` dynamic threshold badge, `#059669` verified GST badge).
- Format all currency with Indian numbering (`en-IN`, e.g., `₹1,24,500.00`) and `tabular-nums`.
